ring Onion|spring onion]]\n* 100 g [[Cookbook:Fish|salted fish]]\n* 100 g shredded [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]]\n* 75 g [[Cookbook:Bean Sprout|bean sprouts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (500 g) cooked jasmine [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Fish sauce|fish sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Heat the oil in non-stick pan. Add the garlic, chilli, and spring onion, and stir-fry for 1 minute until fragrant.\n# Add the salted fish and chicken. Stir until the chicken and salted fish are changing color.\n# Add the rice and bean sprouts, then add the salt, pepper, and fish sauce.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bean sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Salted Fish Fried Rice","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 tbsp cooking oil","sourceText":"2 tbsp cooking oil","amountText":"2 tbsp cooking oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"20 g minced garlic","sourceText":"20 g minced garlic","amountText":"20 g minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"10 g red chopped chilli","sourceText":"10 g red chopped chilli","amountText":"10 g red chopped chilli","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"20 g chopped spring onion","sourceText":"20 g chopped spring onion","amountText":"20 g chopped spring onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"100 g salted fish","sourceText":"100 g salted fish","amountText":"100 g salted fish","amount":null,"unit":n